# Are Mendel's numbers too good to be true? Did Mendel cheat?

=== layout: one-panel


@body

![Slide image 27](assets/source_fidelity/lect07d/image_027.png)

=== layout: stacked-panels


@top

![Slide image 29](assets/source_fidelity/lect07d/image_029.png)

